summary:
  Today's radiology news highlights advancements in AI safety and clinical applications, alongside studies on lifestyle factors impacting cardiovascular health. Key themes include the growing role of AI in medical imaging, the importance of early detection for heart disease, and new research on disease mechanisms and prevention.

